Look out for time in direct reclaims (D-RECLAIMms):
this type of reclaim is “bad” but necessary, and will
cause performance issues. It can hopefully be
eliminated by tuning the other vm sysctl tunables to
engage background reclaim sooner, before direct reclaim
is necessary.
