driver layer to enqueue it on a TX ring for the hardware
to send out, until the hardware signals the kernel that
41

       @start[args->skbaddr] = nsecs; 
} 

tracepoint:skb:consume_skb 
/@start[args->skbaddr]/ 
{ 
       @us = hist((nsecs - @start[args-
>skbaddr]) / 1000); 
       delete(@start[args->skbaddr]); 
